The WebAssembly files in wasm/ are compiled from third-party crates, mainly
Apache-2.0 licensed, including:

  wasm/v011: rgb-invoicing, rgb-ops, rgb-consensus, rgb-schemas, rgb-aluvm,
             rgb-strict-encoding, rgb-strict-types (0.11.1 / 1.0.x)
             https://github.com/rgb-protocol
  wasm/v012: rgb-invoice 0.12.0-rc.3, sonic-callreq, hypersonic, ultrasonic,
             strict_types (RGB-WG / AluVM / LNP-BP)
             https://github.com/RGB-WG https://github.com/AluVM

Exact versions and the full dependency list are in rust/v011/Cargo.lock and
rust/v012/Cargo.lock. Each crate's license applies to its compiled code.

Test vectors in test/vectors/ that come from upstream tests or fixtures say
where they come from in the README next to them.
